      "parameters": {
        "width": 660,
        "height": 250,
        "content": "## IMS · speech workflow\n1. In the Webhook node, select a Header Auth credential named X-IMS-Secret. Set the same secret as N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET in IMS.\n2. For the provider HTTP node, choose a different Header Auth credential: xi-api-key (ElevenLabs). Choose available voice IDs in the preparation node.\n3. Activate this workflow and copy its production HTTPS webhook URL into N8N_SPEECH_WEBHOOK_URL.\n4. Test with non-sensitive lesson content before student use. Disable saving successful execution data."
      }
